      "title": "BOROLTD: Leadership Transition And Potential Fund Raising Will Support Future Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed Borosil's fair value estimate from ₹275 to ₹257.5, citing slightly softer assumptions on revenue growth and profit margins, as well as minor changes to the discount rate and forward P/E expectations. What's in the News The board approved the appointment of Mr. Rituraj Sharma, currently President and Senior Management Personnel, as Chief Executive Officer and Key Managerial Personnel with effect from May 20, 2026.",
