      "date": "2026-05-26T11:40:24.000Z",
      "title": "Consensus EPS estimates fall by 36%",
      "body": "The consensus outlook for earnings per share (EPS) in fiscal year 2027 has deteriorated. 2027 revenue forecast decreased from ₹13.7b to ₹12.5b. EPS estimate also fell from ₹8.15 per share to ₹5.20 per share. Net income forecast to shrink 17% next year vs 36% growth forecast for Consumer Durables industry in India . Consensus price target down from ₹343 to ₹275. Share price fell 6.0% to ₹220 over the past week.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
