      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-05-26T02:06:48.000Z",
      "title": "BOROLTD: Capacity Expansion And New Bharuch Facility Will Support Future Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their fair value estimate for Borosil from ₹342.50 to ₹275.00, citing updated assumptions around revenue growth, profit margin profile and a lower future P/E multiple, despite a slightly reduced discount rate. What's in the News Borosil has scheduled a board meeting on May 19, 2026 at 16:15 IST to consider and approve audited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026, and to seek shareholder approval for potential fund raising through options such as public offer, ADRs / GDRs, foreign currency convertible bonds, debt issuance or qualified institutions placement, subject to approvals (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/consumer-durables/nse-boroltd/borosil-shares/ohw4am4o-premium-kitchenware-demand-and-renewables-will-expand-market-reach-1h37/updates/17-analysts-have-trimmed-their-fair-value-estimate-for-borosil",
